28. Agent Validation Checklist

Before returning the final content, verify all of the following:

- [ ] Headings use "h1.", "h2.", "h3." and not Markdown headings.
- [ ] Bold text uses single asterisks.
- [ ] Italic text uses underscores.
- [ ] Inline code uses double curly braces.
- [ ] Code blocks use the "{code}" macro.
- [ ] Tables use "||" for headers and "|" for normal cells.
- [ ] External links use "[label|URL]".
- [ ] Ordered lists use "#".
- [ ] Unordered lists use "*".
- [ ] Macros have matching opening and closing tags.
- [ ] The output does not contain accidental Markdown syntax.
- [ ] All code indentation is preserved.
- [ ] Section hierarchy is logical.
- [ ] There are no invented links, attachments, owners or system details.
- [ ] Unknown information is marked clearly as a placeholder.
- [ ] The final response is ready to paste into Confluence.

